1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,900
There's only one pottery UNESCO calls world heritage.
全世界·只有一种瓷是世界非遗

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,200
It turns stone and plant ash into jade.
石头和草木灰·烧成玉色

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,500
They call it "plum green" and "misty blue."
叫它梅子青·和粉青

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,800
Perfected 800 years ago, in the Southern Song.
800年前·南宋烧到极致

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,100
The recipe is passed down inside families.
配方·在家族里代代相传

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,400
Fired again and again, up to 1,310 degrees.
反复烧·高达1310度

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,700
One wrong degree, and the jade never appears.
差一度·那抹玉色就出不来

9
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,000
Green so deep it looks wet — but it's stone.
绿得像水·其实是石

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,800
★ Expert Tip: In Longquan, Zhejiang, you can throw and glaze your own piece in a day.
★浙江龙泉·可亲手拉坯上釉

11
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,400
The only ceramic the world vowed to protect. Plum green or misty blue — which is yours?
世界唯一立誓守护的瓷·梅子青还是粉青，你选哪个？
